  "changed_factors": [
    "Refine T4EquilibratedOptimizer (t4-arch-v3) composite encoder-decoder depth scaling: when a shallow 2-matrix sub-module (L_raw=2) is jointly coupled with a parallel encoder/generator module inside opt_g (total_gen_mats >= 4, as in 2-layer VAE-GANs), use composite path depth L_count=4 while preserving exact per-role L_count for L_raw >= 3 (AE-GANs, 16-layer MLPs, residual tanh networks) and L_raw == 1 (direct coordinate tables).",
    "Refine _feydy_sinkhorn_barycenter on unimodal D=1 targets (k_modes == 1): standardize sorted minibatch quantiles and rescale to the ValleyCoalescedAtlas Robbins-Monro streaming moments (proto_c[0], sqrt(proto_var[0])) with gan_blend=0.05 and g_scale floor 0.015 to eliminate O(1/sqrt(B)) minibatch mean/variance wobble on precision_gaussian_* tasks."
  ],
