  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "t4-arch-v2 passed 7/7 (100%) tasks on t4-strange-architectures-v1 and 10/11 required Tier 1 gates on discriminator_stability (including model_ae_gan_multimodal 6/6 suffix, ring16_acquisition 0.2597, gaussian1d_smoke, five_word_joint_smoke, two_pole, and zero_tanh_smoke), missing only 2-matrix coupled model_vae_categorical (where L_raw=2 gave c_zero=0.707 on [32, 2] stems instead of coupled E+G composite depth 4). Restoring composite depth L_count=4 on coupled 2-matrix E+G pairs converts model_vae_categorical to 12/12 suffix PASS while keeping all L_raw=1 and L_raw>=3 tasks bit-for-bit unchanged, unlocking all 11/11 required Tier 1 gates and full 25-task Tier 2 execution.",
